+**Data Structures:**
+The method employs four Multi-Layer Perceptrons (MLPs) with 256 hidden units:
+1.  **$f_{w1}$:** 3 layers.
+2.  **$f_{w2}$:** 6 layers with skip connections.
+3.  **$f_u$ (UDF function):** 8 layers with skip connections.
+4.  **$f_c$ (Color function):** 2 layers.
 
