-**3D Gaussians:**
-Standard 3D Gaussian Splatting representation: mean position $\mu$, covariance $\Sigma$ (parameterized by scale $s$ and rotation $q$), opacity $\alpha$, and spherical harmonics coefficients $c_{lm}$.
